++# 第三批([[Projects/選擇點表第三批業務情境寫法_計劃]]):業務情境寫法——兩種寫法都合法、哪一個對看需求。凡是用到關聯規則(has/inside/precedes)的
++# 一律外包雙重否定 not: {not: …}(同 C-18、C-34~C-37:正面寫的關聯規則會把外層整段節點當次要標記塞進每個命中,輸出平方成長;
++# Systems/kotlin規則包 的 PITFALL)。
++# C-38、C-39 協程作用域:命中 call_expression 第一個子節點的 supervisorScope/coroutineScope 識別字(錨點「運算元起始」),而且這個作用域
++# 有兩個以上子協程(計劃〈用詞〉):子協程是單一識別字 async/launch 的呼叫,往外最近一層 lambda 是作用域自己的大括號(或迴圈呼叫的大括號、
++# 迴圈呼叫往外最近一層是作用域的大括號)。ast-grep 沒有計數:「兩個」用配對(含子協程的節點 X precedes 另一個含子協程的節點 Y);從作用域
++# 大括號 L 往下找一律 stopBy 下一層 lambda_literal(停下那一層也算命中);沿固定鏈 call_suffix → annotated_lambda → lambda_literal 拿 L,
++# 不用 stopBy: end(會越過內層作用域,外層被內層的 async 誤命中;設計審 r1 邊界席、r2 正確性席實跑)。
++# utils 只在同一份規則文件裡有效,C-38 與 C-39 各一份,兩份要一字不差(t_choice_samples_batch3 比對)。
++id: C-38
++language: kotlin
++severity: hint
++message: 協程作用域 supervisorScope(換成 coroutineScope,一支失敗時兄弟一起取消)
++utils:
++  child-co:
++    # 子協程:呼叫名稱是單一識別字 async 或 launch(帶接收者的 scope.launch、this.async 開在別的作用域,不算)
++    kind: call_expression
++    has: {kind: simple_identifier, nthChild: 1, regex: '^(async|launch)$'}
++  has-co:
++    # 本身是子協程,或往下(不越過下一層 lambda)有子協程
++    any:
++      - matches: child-co
++      - has: {matches: child-co, stopBy: {kind: lambda_literal}}
++  loop-call:
++    # 迴圈呼叫:.map/.forEach/.mapIndexed/.forEachIndexed/.flatMap 與頂層 repeat(…),大括號裡的子協程在它的固定鏈 lambda 裡
++    kind: call_expression
++    any:
++      - has: {kind: navigation_expression, nthChild: 1, has: {kind: navigation_suffix, regex: '^(\?\.|\.)\s*(map|forEach|mapIndexed|forEachIndexed|flatMap)$'}}
++      - has: {kind: simple_identifier, nthChild: 1, regex: '^repeat$'}
++    has:
++      kind: call_suffix
++      has:
++        kind: annotated_lambda
++        has:
++          kind: lambda_literal
++          has: {matches: child-co, stopBy: {kind: lambda_literal}}
++  many-co:
++    # 作用域大括號 L 有兩個以上子協程:①兩個子協程配對(同一個陳述裡兩個也算);②一個子協程落在 for/while 本體或迴圈呼叫的大括號裡
++    kind: lambda_literal
++    any:
++      - has:
++          stopBy: {kind: lambda_literal}
++          not: {kind: lambda_literal}
++          matches: has-co
++          precedes: {stopBy: end, matches: has-co}
++      - has:
++          stopBy: {kind: lambda_literal}
++          any:
++            - {kind: for_statement, has: {kind: control_structure_body, has: {matches: child-co, stopBy: {kind: lambda_literal}}}}
++            - {kind: while_statement, has: {kind: control_structure_body, has: {matches: child-co, stopBy: {kind: lambda_literal}}}}
++            - matches: loop-call
++rule:
++  kind: simple_identifier
++  regex: '^supervisorScope$'
++  nthChild: 1
++  not:
++    not:
++      inside:
++        kind: call_expression
++        has:
++          kind: call_suffix
++          has:
++            kind: annotated_lambda
++            has: {matches: many-co}
++---
++id: C-39
++language: kotlin
++severity: hint
++message: 協程作用域 coroutineScope(換成 supervisorScope,一支失敗時兄弟照常做完)
++utils:
++  child-co:
++    # 子協程:呼叫名稱是單一識別字 async 或 launch(帶接收者的 scope.launch、this.async 開在別的作用域,不算)
++    kind: call_expression
++    has: {kind: simple_identifier, nthChild: 1, regex: '^(async|launch)$'}
++  has-co:
++    # 本身是子協程,或往下(不越過下一層 lambda)有子協程
++    any:
++      - matches: child-co
++      - has: {matches: child-co, stopBy: {kind: lambda_literal}}
++  loop-call:
++    # 迴圈呼叫:.map/.forEach/.mapIndexed/.forEachIndexed/.flatMap 與頂層 repeat(…),大括號裡的子協程在它的固定鏈 lambda 裡
++    kind: call_expression
++    any:
++      - has: {kind: navigation_expression, nthChild: 1, has: {kind: navigation_suffix, regex: '^(\?\.|\.)\s*(map|forEach|mapIndexed|forEachIndexed|flatMap)$'}}
++      - has: {kind: simple_identifier, nthChild: 1, regex: '^repeat$'}
++    has:
++      kind: call_suffix
++      has:
++        kind: annotated_lambda
++        has:
++          kind: lambda_literal
++          has: {matches: child-co, stopBy: {kind: lambda_literal}}
++  many-co:
++    # 作用域大括號 L 有兩個以上子協程:①兩個子協程配對(同一個陳述裡兩個也算);②一個子協程落在 for/while 本體或迴圈呼叫的大括號裡
++    kind: lambda_literal
++    any:
++      - has:
++          stopBy: {kind: lambda_literal}
++          not: {kind: lambda_literal}
++          matches: has-co
++          precedes: {stopBy: end, matches: has-co}
++      - has:
++          stopBy: {kind: lambda_literal}
++          any:
++            - {kind: for_statement, has: {kind: control_structure_body, has: {matches: child-co, stopBy: {kind: lambda_literal}}}}
++            - {kind: while_statement, has: {kind: control_structure_body, has: {matches: child-co, stopBy: {kind: lambda_literal}}}}
++            - matches: loop-call
++rule:
++  kind: simple_identifier
++  regex: '^coroutineScope$'
++  nthChild: 1
++  not:
++    not:
++      inside:
++        kind: call_expression
++        has:
++          kind: call_suffix
++          has:
++            kind: annotated_lambda
++            has: {matches: many-co}
++---
